02:12:58.450 --> 02:13:00.970
these other things exist to a certain extent.

3047
02:13:00.970 --> 02:13:02.940
Now it's also true that if you have pain,

3048
02:13:02.940 --> 02:13:04.360
the more you focus just on the pain,

3049
02:13:04.360 --> 02:13:06.667
the more it subsides as well so this stuff is nuanced,

3050
02:13:06.667 --> 02:13:11.667
but I will say that, I just want us to not forget

3051
02:13:12.870 --> 02:13:17.481
that there is a higher nature to humans and this is

3052
02:13:17.481 --> 02:13:20.410
where Maslow really wanted to go with all,

3053
02:13:20.410 --> 02:13:22.610
I read his unpublished essays.

3054
02:13:22.610 --> 02:13:24.277
Right, his work was not done, right?

3055
02:13:24.277 --> 02:13:27.040
And a big part of the book is you extrapolating

3056
02:13:27.040 --> 02:13:30.390
on where he was heading and trying to reinterpret

3057
02:13:30.390 --> 02:13:32.580
and reimagine where that might land.

3058
02:13:32.580 --> 02:13:35.130
Yeah. And a big part of it was that there is an innate,

3059
02:13:35.130 --> 02:13:40.130
intrinsic, higher nature to humans that is just as real

3060
02:13:40.182 --> 02:13:45.182
as our lower nature, but it takes more work to transcend

3061
02:13:47.473 --> 02:13:51.710
all of the forces, internal and external that

3062
02:13:52.690 --> 02:13:55.650
are really keeping us away from being able to see it.

3063
02:13:55.650 --> 02:13:57.100
But there are things we can do.

3064
02:13:57.100 --> 02:13:57.933
There really are.

3065
02:13:57.933 --> 02:14:00.650
And I think it really is about simple choices

3066
02:14:00.650 --> 02:14:01.700
that you start to make.

3067
02:14:01.700 --> 02:14:04.500
And there's a momentum that takes place over time

3068
02:14:04.500 --> 02:14:07.000
when you begin to practice those things

3069
02:14:07.000 --> 02:14:08.120
with some regularity.

3070
02:14:08.120 --> 02:14:12.610
I'll tell you one thing when a surprising intervention

3071
02:14:12.610 --> 02:14:16.410
in clinical psychology for someone who is feeling depressed,

3072
02:14:16.410 --> 02:14:19.590
someone who is feeling, they're saying,

3073
02:14:19.590 --> 02:14:21.670
I always have these obsessive ruminations over and over

3074
02:14:21.670 --> 02:14:23.503
again, help me.

3075
02:14:23.503 --> 02:14:25.460
Here's the hack for that,

3076
02:14:25.460 --> 02:14:27.310
stop thinking about yourself so much.

3077
02:14:29.478 --> 02:14:31.060
Oh, come on, easier said than done.

3078
02:14:31.060 --> 02:14:32.610
Well, but one of the interventions

3079
02:14:32.610 --> 02:14:34.010
that has been scientific studied

3080
02:14:34.010 --> 02:14:36.350
is something called moral elevation.

3081
02:14:36.350 --> 02:14:37.670
So this is a concept

3082
02:14:37.670 --> 02:14:40.410
that my colleague Jonathan (indistinct) studied,

3083
02:14:40.410 --> 02:14:41.610
moral elevation.

3084
02:14:41.610 --> 02:14:44.670
So research shows that a better way to help people

3085
02:14:44.670 --> 02:14:47.150
with these kinds of issues than to keep obsessively talking

3086
02:14:47.150 --> 02:14:51.240
about these issues and to talk about their feelings

3087
02:14:51.240 --> 02:14:55.000
and how they always feel negative emotions is to get them

3088
02:14:55.000 --> 02:15:00.000
in touch with role models with examples of moral humans

3089
02:15:00.230 --> 02:15:02.404
that are doing incredibly inspiring things

3090
02:15:02.404 --> 02:15:06.930
that can elevate your whole emotional system.

3091
02:15:06.930 --> 02:15:07.763
Yeah.

3092
02:15:07.763 --> 02:15:10.040
So, there really is something to helping people

3093
02:15:10.040 --> 02:15:12.327
get more into transcendent states of being,

3094
02:15:12.327 --> 02:15:16.830
getting you outside of yourselves and to not be so neurotic

3095
02:15:16.830 --> 02:15:19.135
because neurotic is a form of narcissism.

3096
02:15:19.135 --> 02:15:20.036
Yeah.

3097
02:15:20.036 --> 02:15:22.230
You're so self-focused and some of the best ways

3098
02:15:22.230 --> 02:15:25.000
of overcoming this is just shifting your attention

3099
02:15:25.000 --> 02:15:26.000
outside of yourself.

3100
02:15:26.930 --> 02:15:31.930
Yeah. In 12-step, the sort of simple tool for are getting

3101
02:15:34.050 --> 02:15:35.740
out of your self-obsession is

3102
02:15:35.740 --> 02:15:39.040
to immediately go help somebody else who needs help.

3103
02:15:39.040 --> 02:15:39.873
There you go.

3104
02:15:39.873 --> 02:15:41.691
Like pick up the phone and just call somebody.

3105
02:15:41.691 --> 02:15:42.946
They got it all right, didn't they?

3106
02:15:42.946 --> 02:15:44.130
We don't even need psychology.

3107
02:15:44.130 --> 02:15:48.757
It's divinely inspired. It's an incredibly profound text

3108
02:15:51.070 --> 02:15:56.070
and rule book for living that feels so ahead of its time

3109
02:15:56.850 --> 02:15:57.900
in certain ways.

3110
02:15:57.900 --> 02:15:59.760
Yeah. So true when I'm around someone

3111
02:15:59.760 --> 02:16:02.290
