3112
02:16:02.290 --> 02:16:04.818
I just like forget about a lot of my problems.

3113
02:16:04.818 --> 02:16:07.920
I'm just like, how do I be more of that guy

3114
02:16:07.920 --> 02:16:10.680
or girl or woman, whatever your gender is,

3115
02:16:10.680 --> 02:16:12.680
how can I be more of that?

3116
02:16:12.680 --> 02:16:15.470
Yeah. But another person who's perhaps struggling

3117
02:16:15.470 --> 02:16:17.400
a little bit more, might look at that person

3118
02:16:17.400 --> 02:16:19.083
