3127
02:16:40.702 --> 02:16:42.370
Like, what is it the threat to people

3128
02:16:42.370 --> 02:16:45.340
when you are being positive or when you're trying to.

3129
02:16:45.340 --> 02:16:46.390
You're a weak beta.

3130
02:16:47.790 --> 02:16:49.860
It's a sort of a beta thing.

3131
